# Import boundaries

Allowed direction:

`APP → FEATURES → SHARED → CORE → COMPONENTS/UI`

- `features/*` must **never** import from other `features/*`
- `components/ui/*` must stay UI-only (no imports from `core`, `shared`, `features`)
- Detail: [docs/01-architecture.md](../docs/01-architecture.md), [docs/03-code-organization.md](../docs/03-code-organization.md)

## Feature public API

- Export via `apps/web/features/<feature>/index.ts`
- Keep `hooks/`, `stores/`, `utils/` private unless explicitly exported

## Defensive programming

- Use `?.` and `??` for nested access
- Lists: empty, loading, error states
- Zod for user input (forms, server actions, route handlers)

## Clean props

- Destructure in signature; ~5–7 props (guideline)
- Boolean shorthand; defaults in destructuring
- Prefer `onEmailChange` over `handleChange`
